{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-xo-poppy-super-power-10000-mah-power-bank-sold-by-tk-maxx-2511-0117","content_id":"bea6f224-b551-4edb-8915-ec71bb414835","description":"Product Recall for XO Poppy Super Power 10,000 mAh Power Banks presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"3e35883c-cf4b-470e-b2d3-034116f1cdc5","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-17T13:36:09+00:00","id":"3e35883c-cf4b-470e-b2d3-034116f1cdc5","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-17T13:36:09+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69b958c9a564b64fbe35ab31/2511-0117-product-recall-xo-poppy-super-power-power-bank.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: XO Poppy Super Power 10,000 mAh Power Bank sold by TK Maxx</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it can overheat during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by TK Maxx.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Chargers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>XO Poppy</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Prints</td>\n      <td>Swan, Leopard, Bow</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>PY-UKPBK10M-BW8, PY-UKPBK10M-LP1, PY-UKPBK10M-SW3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Receipt and Price Ticket Codes</td>\n      <td>014851, 014852, 014853</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Power bank available in three prints - swan, leopard, bow.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_3e35883c-cf4b-470e-b2d3-034116f1cdc5\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69b958c9a564b64fbe35ab31/2511-0117-product-recall-xo-poppy-super-power-power-bank.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as it has poor internal build quality, with wires soldered directly to the PCB with no secondary form of fixing. This could lead to the connections becoming loose over time, causing the product to overheat and ignite leading to a fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulation 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by TK Maxx.\nOwners should stop using the product immediately and return it to your nearest TK Maxx store for a full refund.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access the TK Maxx recall page at the following link: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">Safety notice - Product Recall - TK Maxx UK</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0117</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-17T13:55:19Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-17","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product